

- properties


  // THE FIRST PART IS TYPICALLY MADE BY THINGS OR CONCEPTS

 :: basic annotation ::

 + note/remark             (note)         - is a note or remark about (isnotefor)
 + requirement             (require)      - is a requirement of (isreq)
 + to be decided           (tbd)          - to be figured out    (tbf)
 + has example             (e.g.)         - is an example of     (ex)
 + in other words          (i.e.)         - is a clarification of (clarify)
 + danger score            (danger)       - is a danger score for (isdanger)
 + violates policy         (violation)    - is a violation assessment (isvio)
 + has possible value      (valis)        - is a value for (isval)
 + could indicate          (i)            - may be indicated by (ib)
 + has name (name)       - is the name of (isnameof)
 + in the role of (role) - is a role for (isrole)
 + uses the tool (tool)  - is a tool used by (toolused) 
 
 + is working for (client) - is the work client of (isclient)
 + has policy (policy) - is a policy of (ispolicy)
 + has concept  (concept) - is a concept about (isconcept)
 
 + calls API function (api) - API function called at (isapi)
 + acts or expounds (action) - took place at (isaction)
 + thinks out loud (thinking) - is an internal thought spoken by (thght)
 + is explained by (expl) - expands detail on (expdet)
 + signal possible warning (warn) - is a possible warning (iswarn) 
